 297:source\asw/sound.c **** /**
 298:source\asw/sound.c ****  * \brief Stop the compiler from moving memory accesses across this call (N2).
 299:source\asw/sound.c ****  *
 300:source\asw/sound.c ****  * GNU C inline assembler with a "memory" clobber, no instruction is generated.
 301:source\asw/sound.c ****  */
