 312:source\asw/sound.c ****  * \brief Timer interrupt body: output one sample, swap buffers when needed (N1, N3, N4).
 313:source\asw/sound.c ****  *
 314:source\asw/sound.c ****  * Per tick exactly one of: output a sample (volume scaled), swap + SetEvent(tsk_reader,
 315:source\asw/sound.c ****  * ev_BufEmpty), or count an underrun. Does nothing while the dual buffer path is off.
 316:source\asw/sound.c ****  *
 317:source\asw/sound.c ****  * \return RC_SUCCESS (always)
 318:source\asw/sound.c ****  */
